full-query: "Your company is deploying a Bare Metal Solution for Oracle in Region A and requires the machine to access a Cloud SQL database in Region B. You have established a Dedicated Interconnect between your on-premises network and Region A. What networking configuration should you implement to allow the Bare Metal Solution machine to securely connect to the Cloud SQL database in Region B?"
