  "qid": "252",
  "tip": "<p>When traffic must cross regions over Interconnect or VPN, first check the VPC dynamic routing mode. Choose <i>global</i> when Cloud Router routes need to be usable in every region, and remember that <i>Private Google Access</i> is for API access rather than private IP paths to managed services.</p>",
